{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>So as not to do the statutes of the abomination.</b> That they would embrace and kiss, and from this they come to immorality." "<b>That were done before you.</b> That you not say: since the ancients did so, I too will do so." "<b>I am HaShem your Elohim.</b> I have no need to give a reply for my words — even if you do not know the reason for my commandments. The section of the parashah of Aḥarei Mot is completed."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:20.037334396Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}